| Baked chicken breast with couscous and green beans                     | Handful of mixed nuts      |\n| Saturday | Oat pancakes topped with fresh fruit and maple syrup | Veggie burger on a bun with side salad                                | Shrimp stir fry with snap peas, carrots, and jasmine rice              | Banana with peanut butter  |\n| Sunday   | Chia pudding with mango and coconut flakes      | Egg salad sandwich on whole grain bread with cucumber slices          | Roasted vegetable medley with halloumi cheese and farro                | Orange segments and yogurt cup |\n\n## Tips\n- Prep meals ahead for convenience.\n- Drink plenty of water.\n- Key groceries: eggs, oats, various proteins (chicken, salmon, tofu), fresh veggies, grains (quinoa, rice), fruits, and nuts.\n- Easily adaptable for vegetarian\/vegan preferences.","document_type":"general","include_header":true,"include_page_numbers":true}  
