e (60%), Subscriptions (30%), Maintenance (10%)  \n- Break even: Month 18; $750K profit Year 3  \n- Ask: $500K for 20% equity + board seats  \n\n# Slide 9: Team and Timeline\n\n- Team: CEO (MBA, 10+ years), CTO (PhD solar), Advisors (green funds)  \n- Milestones:  \n  - Q2 2026: Prototype & patent  \n  - Q4 2026: Pilot & revenue  \n  - Q2 2027: National expansion  \n\n# Slide 10: Conclusion and Next Steps\n\n- Poised to lead sustainable charging  \n- Invitation: Partner for green future  \n- Contact: Jane Doe, jane@ecotech.com, (555) 123-4567  \n- Next: Schedule call for details  \n","document_type":"business"}  
