ling.  \n\n### Slide 6: Speed Comparison Bar Chart  \nA bar chart illustrating processing time for a complex problem (e.g., factoring a large number):  \n- Classical Computer: 10,000 years (hypothetical scale).  \n- Quantum Computer: 3 minutes.  \n*(Note: In the generated PPT, this will appear as a simple bar chart with two bars labeled \"Classical\" and \"Quantum,\" showing dramatic time difference for visual impact.)*  \n\n### Slide 7: Conclusion  \n- Quantum computing isn't replacing your laptop\u2014it's a tool for the toughest puzzles.  \n- Stay tuned: We're on the cusp of a quantum era! \ud83d\ude80  \n- Questions?","document_type":"general"}  
