pert in React Native and Node.js\n- Designers and Testers: 4 specialists\n- 500 hours allocated\n- Tools: Jira for tracking, AWS for hosting\n\n## Slide 8: Budget and Pricing\n- Total project cost: $150,000 (fixed)\n- Breakdown:\n  - Planning & Design: $30,000\n  - Development: $80,000\n  - Testing & Deployment: $25,000\n  - Project Management: $15,000\n- Payment: 30% upfront, 40% at prototype, 30% on completion\n\n## Slide 9: Benefits and ROI\n- Annual cost savings: $50,000\n- Productivity increase: 25% via automation\n- Scalable for future growth\n- Expected ROI: 200% within 12 months\n\n## Slide 10: Terms and Conditions\n- Confidentiality: Under NDA\n- Warranty: 90-day post-launch support\n- Termination: 30 days' notice, fees prorated\n- Acceptance: Client approval at milestones\n\n## Slide 11: Next Steps and Contact\n- Schedule a call to discuss\n- Contact: [Your Name] at [email\/phone]\n- Let's bring this vision to life!\n- Thank you","document_type":"proposal","design_style":"warm"}  
